# Release build output. The release workflow downloads signed binaries into
# signed/ and writes the Windows zips into pkg/, both in the checkout root and
# both before GoReleaser runs -- and GoReleaser refuses to build from a dirty
# tree, because artifacts from an unrecognised working directory may not
# correspond to the tag. Ignored rather than moved: they are build output, and
# they should never be committed regardless.
pkg/
signed/